MapCartesian←{
   ⍝ Converts projected polar ⍵ to Cartesian for plotting
   ⍝ Swaps column order: Projection gives (radius,azimuth),
   ⍝ Cartesian expects (theta,rho). Book p.545: "makes allowance
   ⍝ for the fact that altitude and azimuth are conventionally
   ⍝ grouped in the opposite order from right ascension and declination"
   ⍝ Original used ⊖ (reverse rows) but context requires ⌽ (reverse cols)
    ⌽Cartesian⌽⍵ }
